---
// Problema.astro — 3 levels of awareness (Eugene Schwartz)
---

<section class="section problema reveal" id="servicios" aria-label="The problem we solve">
  <h2 class="section-title">A business not on the internet,<br><span class="text-terracota">doesn't exist</span>.</h2>
  <div class="problema-grid">
    <div class="glass-card problema-card tall">
      <h4>They can't find you</h4>
      <p>Your customer searches. Your competitor shows up. <strong>You lost a sale you never knew existed.</strong></p>
    </div>
    <div class="glass-card problema-card">
      <h4>They don't trust you</h4>
      <p>You have 3 seconds. An outdated site screams <strong>"I don't care."</strong> That's your brand now.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="glass-card problema-card">
      <h4>They don't buy</h4>
      <p>Traffic without conversion is just a number. No CTA, no proof, no close. <strong>A brochure that collects dust.</strong></p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
